Henan Province standardizes and integrates the pricing of oral implantation medical services - China News Society
CCTV.com News: Dentures are an ideal choice for many patients with missing teeth, but the price of tens of thousands of yuan per tooth has always been a deterrent for many patients.
This year, with the accelerated implementation of centralized procurement for dental implants, local areas have also begun to prioritize price cuts for dental implants.
Starting from February 10th, the comprehensive price control target for the full process of routine dental implant services in Henan Province is 4300 yuan. The total cost of the full process for a single routine dental implant should not exceed 97% of the control target.
Dental implantation refers to a tooth replacement method where the upper dental prosthesis is supported and retained by a lower structure implanted in the bone tissue.
The staff from Zhengzhou University First Affiliated Hospital said that for a typical single-tooth implant, the price from implantation to final restoration is about 16,000 to 17,000 yuan.
