(Xinhua, July 11) At around 8 p.m. on Sunday, North Korea held a military parade to mark the 75th anniversary of the founding of the People's Army. Not only did Kim Jong-un's daughter, Kim Jai-ae, attend the event, but she also stood on the main platform alongside her father.
